      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### How to read this dashboard\n- **Healthy:** active model shown, requests moving, p95 of single predictions below 200 ms, errors at 0, every segment's drift normal.\n- **Investigate:** anomaly rate above 7.5% (1.5x contamination 0.05), p95 above 200 ms, a segment at warning or critical, or a rollback.\n- **Rollback is live:** every rollback applied through /admin/rollback is counted."
      }
